{"timestamp":"2026-04-29T01:02:41.006Z","type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"agent_message","message":"Yes, the blame/checkpoint data is already loaded. The lag is from render work on every cursor movement.\n\nRoot cause: `Up`/`Down` calls `refreshViewport()` every time in [why_tui.go](/Users/pfleidi/entire/cli/.worktrees/feat/entire-why/cmd/entire/cli/why_tui.go:116). `refreshViewport()` then calls:\n\n```go\nm.viewport.SetContent(m.renderRows())\n```\n\nat [why_tui.go](/Users/pfleidi/entire/cli/.worktrees/feat/entire-why/cmd/entire/cli/why_tui.go:169), which rebuilds the entire file view, not just the visible rows.\n\nThe expensive parts are:\n\n- [why_tui.go](/Users/pfleidi/entire/cli/.worktrees/feat/entire-why/cmd/entire/cli/why_tui.go:222): `renderRows()` loops every row in the file.\n- [why_tui.go](/Users/pfleidi/entire/cli/.worktrees/feat/entire-why/cmd/entire/cli/why_tui.go:233): it re-runs syntax highlighting for all rows.\n- [why_highlight.go](/Users/pfleidi/entire/cli/.worktrees/feat/entire-why/cmd/entire/cli/why_highlight.go:30): Chroma tokenizes the whole file again.\n- [why_highlight.go](/Users/pfleidi/entire/cli/.worktrees/feat/entire-why/cmd/entire/cli/why_highlight.go:38): each tokenized line is formatted again.\n- [why_tui.go](/Users/pfleidi/entire/cli/.worktrees/feat/entire-why/cmd/entire/cli/why_tui.go:257): `renderGutter()` also recomputes `whyLineColumnWidth(m.data.Rows)` per row, and that helper scans all rows at [why_render.go](/Users/pfleidi/entire/cli/.worktrees/feat/entire-why/cmd/entire/cli/why_render.go:75). That accidentally makes part of row rendering O(n²).\n\nI confirmed with a temporary benchmark on a 2,000-line Go file:\n\n```text\nRefreshLargeColor      ~209ms/op   101MB/op   8.6M allocs/op\nRefreshLargeNoColor     ~89ms/op    30MB/op   7.6M allocs/op\nHighlightLarge         ~117ms/op    65MB/op   950k allocs/op\nComputeMetadataWidth   ~0.65ms/op\n```\n\nSo the lag is not from `git blame` or checkpoint lookup during navigation. It is from full-file re-rendering, full-file syntax highlighting, and repeated width/gutter work on every key press.\n\nThe fix should be to cache render artifacts: compute line width, highlighted source lines, and stable gutter/code content once per data/width/color change. Cursor movement should only update `selected`, viewport offset, header/footer, and the old/new selected row marker.","phase":"final_answer","memory_citation":null}}
